        "text_3wnaVB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This private home gym in Northville, Michigan, is a dedicated training space built over multiple phases to deliver a complete commercial-grade workout experience without leaving the house. What started with a functional trainer and a few single-station machines in 2023 grew into a fully equipped strength training facility by early 2026, covering plate loaded machines, selectorized equipment, a full dumbbell lineup, cardio, and even a Pilates reformer. The owner worked with the Fitness Superstore team to plan and design the layout using a professional gym rendering, ensuring every piece of equipment fit the space correctly before a single delivery was made.</p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "text_size": "middle"
          }
        },
        "list_Er4FnF": {
          "type": "list",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "list": "<p>Create a welcoming and unintimidating gym environment for all fitness levels</p>"
